### Cost Efficiency Analysis
**Source:** Multiple sources
**Snapshot:** 2026

MiMo V2.6 Pro's real cost efficiency depends on:
- Prompt caching usage (99% cost reduction on input tokens)
- Task complexity and length
- Context length (1M tokens)
- Token usage per task

The model is positioned as Xiaomi's flagship model, priced at $0.435/$0.87 per 1M tokens. OpenRouter offers a 15% discount, bringing the effective price to $0.3698/$0.7395 per 1M tokens. For cost-sensitive applications, MiMo V2.6 Flash ($0.14/$0.28 per 1M tokens) may be more suitable.

